<section class="section container about" id="about"><div class="section-label"><span>01 / ABOUT</span><span class="tiny-cross">+</span></div><div class="about-layout"><div class="about-portrait"><img src="/images/profile.png" alt="Nam Nhat Pham" loading="lazy" width="260" height="300"><span class="photo-label">THE PERSON BEHIND THE CODE</span></div><div class="about-content"><h2>A systems mindset.<br><span>A human approach.</span></h2><p>I’m Nam, a software engineer who enjoys making complex systems feel simple. My work spans Java services, B2B IoT platforms, and the infrastructure that keeps everything connected.</p><p>At Cumulocity, I worked across Digital Twin Management and the platform core, building backend functionality, improving deployment workflows, and taking changes from implementation to pre-production.</p><a class="inline-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/namnhatpham1995" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">More about me on LinkedIn <span><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 16 16 4M4 4h12v12"/></svg></span></a></div><aside class="about-aside"><span class="mono">A LITTLE MORE ABOUT ME</span><div><span>Approach</span><p>Understand the problem.<br>Build with intention.<br>Make it reliable.</p></div><div><span>Beyond the keyboard</span><p>Hiking, workouts, cooking,<br>and time with friends.</p></div><div class="language-list"><span>Languages</span><p>Vietnamese <b>Native</b><br>English <b>C1</b><br>German <b>B1</b></p></div></aside></div></section>
